#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:836
msgid ""
"Since you only have one variable select the "
"<quote><guibutton>Areas</guibutton></quote> or "
"<quote><guibutton>Columns</guibutton></quote> radio button next to "
"<quote><guilabel>Grouped By:</guilabel></quote>."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom du bara har en variabel väljer du alternativknappen "
"<quote><guibutton>Områden</guibutton></quote> eller "
"<quote><guibutton>Kolumner</guibutton></quote> bredvid "
"<quote><guilabel>Grupperad efter:</guilabel></quote>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:843
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Labels</guibutton></quote> option since the "
"first cell of the Input Range contains a label."
msgstr ""
"Markera <quote><guibutton>Rubriker</guibutton></quote>, eftersom den första "
"cellen i indataområdet innehåller en rubrik."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:849
msgid ""
"Enter C2:C5 in the <quote><guilabel>Cutoff Range:</guilabel></quote> entry "
"of the <quote><guilabel>Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> tab. The "
"<quote><guilabel>Predetermined Cutoffs</guilabel></quote> option will now "
"also be selected (see <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-2\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Ange C2:C5 i fältet <quote><guilabel>Slutintervall:</guilabel></quote> på "
"fliken <quote><guilabel>Slut</guilabel></quote>. Då markeras även "
"<quote><guilabel>Förutbestämda slut</guilabel></quote> (se <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-example-2\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:856
msgid ""
"In the <quote><guilabel>Bins</guilabel></quote> tab select the second option"
" since we want to add two bins reaching to ∓∞ and we want to count each "
"cutoff value in the bin to its right (see <xref linkend=\"histogram-"
"example-3\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"På fliken <quote><guilabel>Grupper</guilabel></quote> väljer du det andra "
"alternativet. Då läggs två grupper som sträcker sig till ∓∞ till, och varje "
"gränsvärde räknas till gruppen till höger (se <xref linkend=\"histogram-"
"example-3\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:861
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Percentage</guibutton></quote> option of the "
"<quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp;Options</guilabel></quote> tab to have the "
"frequencies expressed as percentages."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guibutton>Procent</guibutton></quote> på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote> om frekvenserna "
"ska visas i procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:867
msgid ""
"Select the <quote><guibutton>Column Chart</guibutton></quote> option of the "
"<quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp;Options</guilabel></quote> tab to have a column"
" chart added to the histogram (see <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-4\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Välj <quote><guibutton>Kolumndiagram</guibutton></quote> på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Diagram och alternativ</guilabel></quote> om ett "
"kolumndiagram ska läggas till i histogrammet (se <xref linkend=\"histogram-"
"example-4\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:875
msgid ""
"In the <quote><guilabel>Output</guilabel></quote> tab, specify the output "
"options as described in <xref linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Ange utdatainställningarna på fliken "
"<quote><guilabel>Utdata</guilabel></quote> enligt beskrivningen i <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:885
msgid ""
"The results are shown in <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-5\"/>. Note that "
"the graph will by default appear on top of the histogram table. It usually "
"needs to be moved in to proper position. That has already been done here."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet visas i <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-5\"/>. Som standard "
"placeras diagrammet ovanpå histogramtabellen. Vanligtvis behöver det flyttas"
" till rätt plats, vilket redan har gjorts i det här exemplet."

